{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgdYVCtz2sBVqrceiy8Ws","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"OpenAI's stated reason for revising its Model Spec is that its models are taking more consequential actions, and instructions cannot anticipate every situation they will meet. In the October 29 update, the company says models need to understand human intentions and values well enough to use good judgment where their instructions are silent, while staying faithful to human intent and oversight. The revision reorganizes the Spec around five values so that individual behaviors can be traced back to a reason.\n\nThe new section on faithfulness to human intent starts from the idea that what people value is primary, and that instructions are ordinarily the clearest and most important signals of those values. OpenAI says this borrows from the assistance-games framing of alignment. Instructions stay central, and the model is asked to read them alongside conversations, memories and other context, and to consider the effects of its work on other people. The Spec also now calls the model \"GPT\" instead of \"the assistant,\" which OpenAI ties to the growing range of use cases and deployment settings.\n\nThe more consequential piece is still unpublished. OpenAI says it is exploring new training methods meant to teach models the core values and why the Spec's principles matter, so they can apply them in new situations and, in its words, do the right things for the right reasons. It promises results and lessons in future updates. The published Spec describes the behavior OpenAI is working toward and, by its own account, the models do not yet fully reflect it. Whether training on reasons produces better judgment than training on rules is a claim the company has yet to support with results, and that evidence will determine how much the reorganization changes in practice."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1323,"cache_read_input_tokens":5318,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1323},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a078e45d-a647-4fa3-9837-d88646382f77","uuid":"bb12882b-9f11-45ca-a8ea-874fa5c49bdf","timestamp":"2026-11-02T05:24:20.802Z","request_id":"req_011CgdYVChLRdzoWBdod1Tzy"}
